      "cooked": "<p>Hi All,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I came to the sentinels party very recently, and I am crazy for the game.&nbsp; That being said, I missed the all of the kickstarters.&nbsp; So, is there any way to get the promo versions of the heros and villians (I have either purchased or ordered all of the existing expansions including the minis)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I know that there are scans of the cards that can be printed or whatever, but the insane completionist part of my brain wants the actual cards if possible.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Alternately, would someone be willing to sell me their&nbsp;promo&nbsp;cards?&nbsp; Shoot me an email:&nbsp; <a href=\"mailto:acseric@yahoo.com\">acseric@yahoo.com</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks!!!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Eric&nbsp;</p>",
