      "created_at": "2013-03-07T17:31:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Promo villains are easy, as they come as part of the oversized villains pack. As for the heroes, it is just a matter of finding people willing to sell them to you, or else waiting; it has been stated that once all Sentinels games has been released &gt;G will probably put out a promo pack of all the promo heroes. However, they will have different art or something similar to differentiate them from the limited-edition ones, so you may prefer the proactive option.</p>",
